<span id="A2.T1.2.4.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A2.T1.2.4.3.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">In the storm, the tree fell down and crashed through the roof of my house. Now, I have to get it removed.</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A2.T1.2.4.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t">
<span id="A2.T1.2.4.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A2.T1.2.4.4.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">In the storm, the trees fell down and crashed through the roof of my house. Now, I have to get them removed.</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A2.T1.2.4.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t">[tree, it, trees, them]</td></tr>
